   * [Corrosive Needle (Tier-D)]
 * **Passive Traits:**
   * [Dense Fiber Network (Tier-E)]
   * [Low-Light Spatial Perception (Tier-E)]
   * [Obsidian Carapace (Tier-D)]
   * [Viper's Resilience (Tier-D)]
He closed the screen, faded back into the shadows of the subway tunnel, and began his silent climb back to Anvil Ridge.
